[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445654763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98658#issuecomment-2445654763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98658","id":2445654763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rxbrr","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T01:54:22Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T01:55:05Z","body":"I don't see how call_deferred would work on resources, resources don't _process or _physics_process.\r\n\r\nOnly class extending `Node` class `_process` or `_physics_process`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445654763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445661373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98658#issuecomment-2445661373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98658","id":2445661373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RxdS9","user":{"login":"MrRevington","id":17320124,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIwMTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17320124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington","html_url":"https://github.com/MrRevington","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T02:01:06Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T02:13:12Z","body":"> I don't see how call_deferred would work on resources, resources don't _process or _physics_process.\r\n> \r\n> Only class extending `Node` class `_process` or `_physics_process`.\r\n\r\nI wondered that too but as I wrote it works for Object, even not being inside the Scene Tree so _process / _physics_process wouldn't get called anyway.\r\n\r\nAnd if _processs or _physics_process is needed for it to work, why is call_deferred on Object? Hm.\r\n\r\n--\r\nUpdate:\r\nUsing `self.reference()` inside the _init of TestResource makes call_deferred work.\r\n\r\nI wonder if it has something to do with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/74101\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445661373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445675154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98658#issuecomment-2445675154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98658","id":2445675154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RxgqS","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T02:11:59Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T02:12:24Z","body":"Can you let me know what type the object is which you're calling call_deferred from?\r\n\r\nObject is a base class so it does nothing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445675154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445679279","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98658#issuecomment-2445679279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98658","id":2445679279,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rxhqv","user":{"login":"MrRevington","id":17320124,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIwMTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17320124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington","html_url":"https://github.com/MrRevington","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T02:16:40Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T02:18:59Z","body":"> Can you let me know what type the object is which you're calling call_deferred from?\r\n> \r\n> Object is a base class so it does nothing.\r\n\r\nlike in resource.gd in the MRP.\r\nupdated to this with self.reference() the  call_deferred works even in Resource.\r\n```GDSCRIPT\r\nextends Resource\r\nclass_name TestResource\r\n\r\n@export var name : String = \"DefaultName\"\r\n\r\nfunc _init() -> void:\r\n\tprint(\"TestResource::_init\")\r\n\tself.reference()\r\n\t_post_init.call_deferred()\r\n\tprint(\"TestResource::_init end\")\r\n\t\r\n\r\nfunc _post_init() -> void:\r\n\tprint(\"TestResource::_post_init\")\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445679279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445714266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98658#issuecomment-2445714266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98658","id":2445714266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RxqNa","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T02:49:20Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T02:49:20Z","body":"My thought was the call deferred uses the message queue system. I don't know that much about it but your reasoning makes sense it should work.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445714266/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446276967","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98658#issuecomment-2446276967","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98658","id":2446276967,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rzzln","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T09:16:04Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T11:38:29Z","body":"Resources are reference counted. If nothing is referencing them, they are freed automatically. Message Queue does not keep reference to RefCounted objects, so if they get dereferenced, the deferred call will be silently dropped.\r\n\r\nThis will work (resource is kept inside a variable)\r\n```GDScript\r\nvar resource: Resource\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tresource = YourResource.new()\r\n```\r\nThis won't (resource is freed immediately)\r\n```GDScript\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tYourResource.new()\r\n```\r\nThis will work too (await keeps method's current stack)\r\n```GDScript\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tvar resource = YourResource.new()\r\n\tawait get_tree().process_frame\r\n\t# Resource is freed here.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446276967/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446750283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98658#issuecomment-2446750283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98658","id":2446750283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R1nJL","user":{"login":"MrRevington","id":17320124,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIwMTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17320124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington","html_url":"https://github.com/MrRevington","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrRevington/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T11:35:15Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T11:35:15Z","body":"> Resources are reference counted. If nothing is referencing them, they are freed automatically. Message Queue does not keep reference to RefCounted objects, so if they get dereferenced, the deferred call will be silently dropped.\r\n\r\nThis! Just tested it with updating the MRP and it works fine with your corrections.\r\nThank you both for your help! :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446750283/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]